                ["AnnotationFormatError" "AnnotationTypeMismatchException" "Documented" "ElementType"
                 "IncompleteAnnotationException" "Inherited" "Native" "Repeatable" "Retention"
                 "RetentionPolicy" "Target"])
           (map #(str "src/java.base/share/classes/java/lang/" % ".java")
                ["Deprecated" "FunctionalInterface" "SafeVarargs"])))))

;; Generic reflection (doc/classes/JAVA-DEFERRED-TRIAGE.md, F25, "As built: F25 (write-ahead)"):
;; java.lang.reflect's generic types and jdk26u's sun.reflect.generics whole (the Signature parser,
;; its trees, the visitor that reifies them, the core reflection factory, the scopes, the
;; repositories and the reflective objects), unchanged but TypeVariableImpl (variant
;; overlay/jdk/variants/TypeVariableImpl.ae: no type annotations recorded yet, no ReflectionFactory
;; copies). jrt's Class, Method, Constructor and Field (hand-written Go, classdata.ae) call it through
;; jrt's own jdk.internal.jrt.ReflectSupport (overlay) with the recorded Signature attributes
;; (arbace.classes.annot's S and G records). GenericDeclaration and TypeVariable have stand-ins in
;; jrt's own build (standin_reflectsupport.ae), replaced by these translations.
(def generics-sources
