           ;; toString without java.lang.invoke's MethodHandleInfo)
           ["java/lang/invoke/SerializedLambda.java"]))))

;; java.io's classes jrt lacked (doc/classes/JAVA-CONFORMANCE-SURVEY.md, JCS92 (c), "As built:
;; JC6b"): jdk26u's plain Java over the streams the closure has; RandomAccessFile's natives are
